WEBVTT

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:10.670
Choose a role guide. Each guide explains the actions, responsible person and result you should expect.

00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:17.420
Read the status first. Status chips show what has happened, what is waiting and which action comes next.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:24.170
Follow the audit reference. Decisions remain attributable and connected to the relevant record version.

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:30.920
Keep human approval visible. Review queues make clear who is responsible and prevent one participant from self-approving.
